      "title": "範例1：試計算下列各式的值",
      "question_text": "試計算下列各式的值：(1)$125^{- \\frac{4}{3}}$ (2)$(3^{- 2})^{3} + (\\frac{1}{3})^{6} + (3^{3})^{- 2} + 3^{- 5} + (\\frac{1}{3})^{5}$\n(3)$[(\\frac{1}{4})^{6} \\cdot 64]^{- 4}(32)^{- 3}$ (4)$[(- \\frac{1}{2})^{3} \\times (\\sqrt{3})^{- 5}]^{0}$﹒",
      "answer_text": "(1) $\\frac{1}{625}$；(2) $\\frac{1}{81}$；(3) $512$；(4) $1$",
      "explanation_text": "【解析】(1)$125^{- \\frac{4}{3}} = (5^{3})^{- \\frac{4}{3}} = 5^{- 4} = \\frac{1}{5^{4}} = \\frac{1}{625}$﹒\n(2)原式$= \\frac{1}{3^{6}} + \\frac{1}{3^{6}} + \\frac{1}{3^{6}} + \\frac{1}{3^{5}} + \\frac{1}{3^{5}} = \\frac{1 + 1 + 1 + 3 + 3}{3^{6}} = \\frac{9}{3^{6}} = \\frac{1}{81}$﹒\n(3)原式= [(2 ^{−2})^{6} ⋅ 2^{6}] ^{−4} ⋅ (2^{5}) ^{−3} = (2 ^{−12} ⋅ 2^{6}) ^{−4} ⋅ 2 ^{−15} = (2 ^{−6}) ^{−4} ⋅ 2 ^{−15} = 2^{24} ⋅ 2 ^{−15} = 2^{9} = 512﹒\n(4)原式=1﹒",
