      "id": "q-s1-1-4-0008",
      "title": "範例4：指數定義與限制判斷",
      "question_text": "下列敘述，何者正確？\n(A)設a，b$\\in$R，則$a^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\cdot b^{\\frac{1}{2}} = (ab)^{\\frac{1}{2}}$\n(B)設a，b$\\in$R，b $\\neq$ 0，則$\\frac{a^{\\frac{1}{2}}}{b^{\\frac{1}{2}}} = (\\frac{a}{b})^{\\frac{1}{2}}$\n(C)設a$\\in$R，則$(\\sqrt{a})^{2} = a$\n(D)設a$\\in$R，則$\\sqrt{a^{2}} = |a|$\n(E)若$a^{m} = a^{n}$，則$m = n$。",
      "answer_text": "選$(C)(D)$",
      "explanation_text": "【解析】(A)當$a<0$，$b<0$時，$\\sqrt{a}\\sqrt{b}=-\\sqrt{ab}$，即$a^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\cdot b^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\neq (ab)^{\\frac{1}{2}}$。\n(B)當$a>0$，$b<0$時，$\\frac{\\sqrt{a}}{\\sqrt{b}}=-\\sqrt{\\frac{a}{b}}$，故$\\frac{a^{\\frac{1}{2}}}{b^{\\frac{1}{2}}} \\neq (\\frac{a}{b})^{\\frac{1}{2}}$。\n(C)當$a\\ge 0$時，$(\\sqrt{a})^{2}=a$顯然成立；當$a<0$時，$(\\sqrt{a})^{2}=(\\sqrt{a})(\\sqrt{a})=-\\sqrt{a\\cdot a}=-\\sqrt{(-a)^{2}}=-(-a)=a$。\n(D)當$a\\ge 0$時，$\\sqrt{a^{2}}=|a|$顯然成立；當$a<0$時，$\\sqrt{a^{2}}=\\sqrt{(-a)^{2}}=|-a|=|a|$。\n(E)當$a=0,1,-1$時，可能有$a^{m}=a^{n}$但$m\\neq n$。\n故選(C)(D)。",
      "chapter_code": "s1-1-4",
      "formula_id": "s1-1-4-exponent-domain",
      "difficulty": "易",
      "question_category": "基本",
      "source_type": "docx_pack_markdown",
